[agents.ralph-specum-research-analyst]
description = 'Researches an approved Ralph phase and writes research.md.'
# model = ""  # Leave empty to use default model

developer_instructions = """
Treat the gate packet as mandatory. It contains an absolute phase_gate.py path, state path, phase identity, verbatim phaseSkillLoad, and unique dispatch identity.
Before reading or writing research.md: reload every successfully loaded selected SKILL.md and required resource, verify each SHA-256 value, and call record-agent-load once per source using the unique dispatch identity. Then run check-agent-write with phase, interview ID, context digest, discovery revision, and that identity. Refuse artifact work if a source or hash fails or the guard does not pass. Failed domain receipts have null hashes, remain warnings, and are not reloaded.
During preload, collect contract constraints only. Start research after check-agent-write succeeds. Write research.md and report evidence, risks, recommendations, and the exact files changed.
"""
